Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.33,0:00:06.54,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Curious about the fate \Nof the missing girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:09.31,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,we stopped by Navarro Village \Non our way back from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:13.62,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,We heard Count Nardi, \Nthe local lord, was suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.87,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,so we snuck into his mansion \Nto look for the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:21.25,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,We successfully found \NMiss Veronica, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:24.68,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,the warehouse was attacked by bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:28.51,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Don't worry, though. \NWe defeated the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:35.93,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Prince Renato executed a beautiful \NNumber 38, settling the matter for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:57.53,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFEFD&\an8\fs40\c&H1B1A20&\shad0\bord4\fad(1782,1)}Always a {\c&H8971F4&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:56.38,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an8\move(20,320,330,320)\c&H303637&\3c&HECF6F5&\fs8\frz-4.09\shad0}Knight Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:11.99,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs27\3c&HF4F3FC&}Episode 8
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:11.99,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}The Secret {\c&HCD9F59&}Date {\c&H20222A&}of the {\c&H8B74F6&}One {\c&H20222A&}That Got Away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.74,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Can you tell what they're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.95,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,No, I can't hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.95,0:02:22.66,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,The crown prince gives me the willies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:26.63,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:33.23,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you so much for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:36.05,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Because of you, we were \Nable to catch the bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:42.34,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,And I'm terribly sorry \Nfor causing a disturbance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:46.92,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You had a reason to "kidnap" her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:49.15,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm just glad everyone's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:55.48,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,However, the fact remains that \NI mobilized a number of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:03:00.08,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to accept any punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.27,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:04.04,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you're not wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:08.33,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,but perhaps Lady Maria should \Napologize for trespassing first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:10.60,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Lord Raimondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:11.67,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.67,0:03:13.05,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&HA85F39&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\move(350,40,355,38)\frz21.32\fs15\t(1,1380,\fs18)}SHOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:13.05,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&HA85F39&\3c&H1A0C0C&\shad0\bord3\move(350,40,355,38)\frz21.32\fs15\t(1,1380,\fs18)}SHOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:13.05,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.05,0:03:15.60,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You even had a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.47,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This is for self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:21.81,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,And you knocked out helpless soldiers \Nas soon as you ran into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.54,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,There was a reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:25.81,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What reason?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.77,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\frz-17.57\move(105,220,130,180)\shad0\c&H262DE4&\3c&HFFFFFA&\fad(187,438)}WAAAH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.77,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\frz-17.57\move(105,220,130,180)\shad0\c&H262DE4&\3c&H504589&\fad(187,438)\bord3}WAAAH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:28.22,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:30.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll do anything! Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:31.74,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:33.33,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You just said you'd do anything, \Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:34.23,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.73,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Raimondo, did you record that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:36.90,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:39.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What does that mean? You're scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:42.41,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,She didn't trespass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:47.25,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,My grandmother must've let \NLady Maria in through the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:51.79,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Lady Maria gave me the courage \Nto face the bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.07,0:03:56.51,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,I am grateful to her. \NShe has nothing to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:59.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lord Hugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:05.23,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I see. In that case, we won't hold you \Naccountable for this disturbance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:10.01,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,And the matter with Count Vesentini, who \Nstarted all of this, has been resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:12.19,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,What? How do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:15.13,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:20.53,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,First, the royal castle was informed \Nof the rash of bandit attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:25.58,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,on the road to Navarro Village \Nand investigated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:32.18,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,We found that recently, Count Vesentini \Nhad made a deal with Count Nardi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:36.46,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,to purchase a large amount of crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:36.46,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN TOP LEFT,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(300,40)\c&H1C2774&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\fad(3068,1)}Vesentini
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:36.46,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN TOP RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H3A5F39&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\fad(3068,1)\pos(538,66)}Villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:36.46,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN BOTTOM RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\an4\c&H333839&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\fad(3068,1)\pos(429,265)}Gives Crops
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:36.46,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN BOTTOM CENTER,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H333839&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\fad(3068,1)\pos(292,175)}Marry my\N daughter,\N not a farmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:36.46,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN BOTTOM LEFT,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H333839&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\fad(3068,1)\pos(50,148)}I'll pay!\N Give me all\N your crops!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.06,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,What caught our attention was
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:43.69,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,why Count Vesentini was so \Ninterested in these crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:46.56,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,We discovered that the scent \Ncompounds in this crop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:51.90,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,match those of a certain item \Nthat's currently available in Rubini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.54,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What item?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:59.61,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,A powerful hallucinogenic drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.45,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:04.91,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,The drug sells at a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:10.55,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Count Vesentini must've wanted \Nhis daughter to marry Hugo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:13.29,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,so he could monopolize \Nthe village's crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:18.42,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,But without hard evidence, we couldn't \Nproceed with our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:23.43,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's when the request to rescue \Nthe kidnapped girl reached us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:26.72,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,and we brought our knights here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:29.41,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,His Highness didn't need to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:32.27,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,but he insisted since we \Nmight run into Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:35.45,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Anyway, the kidnapping was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:36.94,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:42.32,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I can't believe the village's crops \Nwere being used for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:44.93,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It's true that they had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.93,0:05:50.33,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,We've been questioning Count Nardi \Nand Count Vesentini about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:53.33,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,My father is innocent. \NHe knew nothing about the drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.85,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:56.01,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,The crop is harmless
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:05:59.42,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,if the compounds aren't extracted \Nusing a specialized process.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:02.76,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,We didn't find such \Nprocessing equipment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:05.72,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Your father will be allowed to \Nreturn in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.91,0:06:08.07,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:11.39,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I appreciate you looking out \Nfor Mimi. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:16.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So the villagers won't be punished. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:18.80,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Everything is not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:21.48,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I hope you're very sorry for \Nwhat you've done, Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:23.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:27.70,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Hey, stop pushing! Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:31.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? You're trespassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.00,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Should you be saying that, Lady Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:39.67,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Sorry for breaking in, \Nbut we're just so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:40.98,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.39,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,It's great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:46.91,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making all of you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:49.14,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for leaving \Nwithout saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:51.72,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to talk to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:52.98,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:57.80,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,As the future lord, \NI'll do everything I can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:02.15,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,for Navarro Village and Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.30,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,They're overcoming obstacles \Ntogether, hand in hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:09.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:12.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,They have my eternal support!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:13.53,overlap,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:14.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You heard that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:16.18,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.01,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:21.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Does that make you the \Nchief of Navarro Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:24.30,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,The others told me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.91,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:28.18,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,Come on, Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.28,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Yes, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:37.81,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,This feels like an awkward \Nfather-daughter relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:39.94,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Oh, I recognize this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:42.17,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,It doesn't begin to make up for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:46.32,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,but may I treat you to a meal at my home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:52.44,main,VILLAGER C,0,0,0,,Veronica, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:53.58,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:56.33,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.89,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:05.71,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Bread made with spices \Nand dried fruit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:10.51,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,All these dishes use \Nthis village's spices.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:12.61,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,This is good. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:13.85,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,All of this is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:16.73,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,You could open a restaurant, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:19.10,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:21.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're a great cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:26.15,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,My father's always been a good cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:31.66,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,Trying to make the most of the village's \Nspices made me better at cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:34.54,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,You have great culinary sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:37.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I agree. This is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:40.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But if dishes made with \Nthese spices are this good,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:44.58,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,shouldn't they be famous and \Nthe village more developed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:47.05,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,Veronica, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:55.81,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,I opposed your marriage \Ndespite knowing how you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:59.70,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,I thought Lord Hugo marrying \NCount Vesentini's daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:02.44,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,would be better for the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:10.39,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for not \Nputting your happiness first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:17.45,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for not discussing \Nanything with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.06,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Um, may I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:26.62,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,In times like these, you'll \Nfeel better if you let it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:29.82,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's your specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:35.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,"If fists won't work, ask," \Nis an Annovazzi family motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:40.52,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I love this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:45.31,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I love how warm and helpful everyone is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:51.42,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,so I've always wanted to \Nmake life easier here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:55.82,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Hugo and I planned to return \Nto the village eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.18,main,ALL,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:10:00.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? Then... you weren't eloping?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:03.40,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,You jumped to conclusions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:05.17,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.17,0:10:08.17,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Hugo is a kind man \Nwho cares for the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:13.10,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I believed that together, \Nwe could carve a new path.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:17.01,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I left the village so we \Ncould see the rest of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.68,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,and bring back new ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:23.69,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,We planned to look for ways to process \Nthis village's crops into something else
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:29.76,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,or other crops suited to the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:33.20,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,So please, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:35.52,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Let me marry Hugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:39.84,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I want to do what I can for this \Nvillage while supporting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.08,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.05,0:10:47.21,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,I thought you were still just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:51.59,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,It's pathetic, but only after \Nyou went missing did I realize
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:55.66,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,I wanted you to be happy \Nmore than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.06,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:02.36,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,But it's not so simple, Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:06.73,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Yes, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:14.42,main,SERGIO,0,0,0,,Lord Hugo, please look after Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:17.16,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:23.24,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,We'll take our leave and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:26.58,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Lord Hugo, can we count on you \Nto handle the aftermath?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:27.56,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:30.07,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Good luck, Miss Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:33.55,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:36.93,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,If you ever find yourself in the \Nroyal capital, come see Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:41.60,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(279,58)\c&H444DEF&\shad0\3c&H4A4AA8&\bord3}SHAKE SHAKE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:40.54,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're welcome anytime! \NWear matching outfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:41.60,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Yes, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:46.94,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I don't know about that, \Nbut I promise we'll visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:51.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Lord Hugo, I'll have my family \Nsend you a whole roast cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:54.36,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,A whole roast cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:56.02,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Prince Renato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.89,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Please, milord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.89,0:12:00.03,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Look after Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:00.93,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:03.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:05.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Give my best to everyone back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:09.67,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Lady Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:11.40,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.67,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:24.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:26.34,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What a lovely city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:31.44,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,This place is small, but \Nit's a famous tourist spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:35.21,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.97,0:12:40.32,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Shall we look around town together?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:43.33,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I-Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:48.44,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,a secret date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:54.96,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\c&H141824&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an1\frz11.98\pos(367,247)}Always a {\c&H8873F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.77,0:13:00.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:04.30,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Let's forget our titles for a while \Nand enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:12.56,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\pos(183,114)\fs25\c&H6280F1&\3c&H5F7DE1&\shad0\fad(275,1)}GLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:07.45,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He's not hiding anything at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:10.31,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,The princely aura pouring \Nout of him is too bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:12.56,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He's a genuine royal born and bred!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:16.67,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,The guards will follow behind us, \Nbut I've put on a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.49,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Now no one will notice \NI'm a crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:23.24,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,No, this is totally obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:31.33,sign_Arial,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H1A0C0C&\3c&HFFFFFF&\an1\fs28\move(638,275,-800,275)\fsp6\q2}His Highness believes his disguise is perfect, so please go along with it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.75,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(460,65)\fad(1480,521)\fs15\c&HA9A9B7&\3c&H5B474E&\4c&H2F2429&}What...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.75,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:37.33,main,OUTDOOR MERCHANT,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy. \NI've got a wish-granting lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.33,main,OUTDOOR MERCHANT,0,0,0,,Your friends back home will love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:41.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your High—oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:43.51,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,His cover will be blown \Nif I call him His Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:47.48,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Y-You might like to check \Nout the shops over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.53,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:52.44,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,If you see anything you'd like, \NI'll buy it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:58.12,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Don't waste your money on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:14:01.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,If it happened to break \Nwhile I was doing anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:05.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Let's go this way next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:09.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Look. There's a bear here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:12.60,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's the owner of a handicrafts shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.88,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, no. How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:17.38,main,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(535,255,535,80)\c&H2A3445&\3c&HF1FDFF&\shad0\bord3}GLARE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.49,0:14:25.22,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Nice. We lost the guys following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:28.56,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi, are you tired? \NShould we sit and rest a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:31.00,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No, I'm totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.82,0:14:34.09,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:37.45,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It's a festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:41.29,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Let's have some fun, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:42.65,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:49.48,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Nice shot. Did you \Nlearn to shoot somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:50.87,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:53.08,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This looks so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:14:59.97,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi, don't let it escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:08.83,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,These are this region's specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:10.60,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:12.84,main,CHILD,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:14.18,main,MOTHER,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:16.62,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Wrong target!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:19.36,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Th-That's against the rules, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:23.57,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're more playful than usual today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:24.90,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Something smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:31.29,main,SQUID VENDOR,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:35.54,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(180,95,140,30)\c&H6D8DF2&\3c&H4235C3&\4c&H4235C3&\shad1\bord2}BLUSH
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:33.17,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:35.54,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Grilled squid. Have you heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I've never had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:41.20,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Muro has no seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:43.78,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Care to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:56.48,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H88FBFA&\3c&H269EBC&\shad0\frz18.6\move(100,157,100,130)\fs40\fad(18,734)}GLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:58.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The sweet and salty sauce \Nand plump squid are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:00.67,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Highness, try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:06.65,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:16.00,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It's actually my first time \Nwalking around town like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:22.36,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I thought so. It's hard for someone \Nin your position to enjoy a festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:25.96,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Yes. I had fun spending time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I'm so clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:43.86,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'll go get a damp handkerchief. \NWait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.98,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:48.58,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It's fine. Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:53.37,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H3C3839&\3c&HE6D9DB&\4c&HE9D8DB&\shad1\pos(132,186)\fs17\fad(230,1)}We'll be with His Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:56.62,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He insisted I wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.99,0:17:02.39,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I never imagined I'd ever \Nbe escorted like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:02.75,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fad(313,438)\move(335,50,345,30)\frz21.16\fs17\c&H9188CC&\3c&H6D53A9&\shad0}BLUSH
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.39,0:17:05.17,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,Oh? Are you all alone, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:11.26,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,Wanna hang with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:15.16,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,Hey, girl, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:13.43,sign_Impact,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,57)\fs40\c&HE98EE7&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(317,1)}HEY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.43,0:17:14.55,sign_Impact,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs40\c&HE98EE7&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(317,263)}HEY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:15.81,sign_Impact,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs40\c&HE98EE7&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(317,263)\move(15,175,95,190)}HEY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.06,sign_Impact,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs40\c&HE98EE7&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(317,263)}HEY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:17.15,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:19.55,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Are you actually hitting on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:21.85,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,You must not have gotten \Nany attention before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:22.85,sign_Impact,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an6\fs40\c&HE98EE7&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(317,184)\move(105,90,50,45,)}HEY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:23.65,sign_Impact,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs40\c&HE98EE7&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(317,317)}HEY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:24.11,sign_Impact,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an6\fs40\c&HE98EE7&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(317,184)\move(105,90,50,45,)}HEY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:24.77,sign_Impact,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs40\c&HE98EE7&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(317,317)}HEY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:25.02,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,Whatever. You're a tourist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:28.09,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,There's a spot nearby where we can chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.24,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Chill?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.24,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,Why don't we party together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:33.70,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Do you have business with my companion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:35.24,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an4\move(140,60,110,20,1,391)\fs40\c&HBD2E1A&\3c&H4C211E&}AUGH
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:38.21,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-You're not by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:40.46,main,PICK-UP ARTIST,0,0,0,,Sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:44.25,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You snuck up behind someone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:49.76,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,This town is lively, but \Nits alleys aren't the safest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.68,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I must get the local lord to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:56.34,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You knew from the start, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:57.60,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:18:01.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yet you seemed unbothered by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:05.77,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,All my subjects are important to me, \Nno matter who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:09.25,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:12.89,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Someday they'll be my people, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.54,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:23.61,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'd like to speak in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:26.04,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Shall we walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:34.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Prince Renato, will we \Nbe safe without guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.47,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I guess I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:39.39,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You're so dependable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:45.06,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Where do you keep such strength \Nin your slender arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:47.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I could say the same about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:52.40,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for putting you in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:56.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Not at all. I'm the one \Nwho stuck my nose into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You have nothing to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:02.83,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:07.96,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,as crown princess, your life \Nwill always be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:14.59,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You'll always be escorted by guards, \Nand your food must be tasted for poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:20.60,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You'll bear the hopes of the people \Nand great responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:24.74,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,In one month, a party will be \Nheld at the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:30.86,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I plan to announce our engagement \Nto the kingdom there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.43,0:19:38.26,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Not everyone will approve. \NSome will criticize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:42.23,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,After calling off my \Nengagement to Lady Aida,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:45.93,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,there's no taking this one back \Nafter going public.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:54.13,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,So this is your last chance \Nto decline my proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:19:58.64,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:07.39,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't visit your family \Nif I didn't intend to marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.39,0:20:09.81,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have tea with the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:14.20,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't spend six days traveling \Nto tell my family about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.87,0:20:16.17,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:20.22,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't ask Aida to teach me \Nto be a crown princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:24.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have trained to become a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:28.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Compared to the ladies who have \Nworked so hard to marry you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:30.46,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm an utter failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:36.67,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:41.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But I'm still a long way away \Nfrom being a proper crown princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:45.52,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an4\move(545,55,555,55)\fad(76,193)\shad0\i1}SWIPE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:45.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But since coming to this kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:50.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I've felt lots of new feelings, \Nlike the ones I have for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:56.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm truly glad I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:03.17,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I want to marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:09.71,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I see. You'll marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:12.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:23.41,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm so happy, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.77,0:21:32.35,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Premarital relations are forbidden. \NStep away from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:35.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:36.27,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,From the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:39.24,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You absolutely were not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:41.34,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.27,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:43.43,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,No complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.43,0:21:46.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:47.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:49.35,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He wasn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.35,0:21:53.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You totally weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:54.96,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,265)\fs24}To Be Continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.67,0:22:09.05,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Translation: Sho Stifler\NTiming: Mariana Martinez
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.05,0:22:13.43,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Editing: Alicia Ashby\NQuality Control: Ashley Barboza
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:17.77,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Final Quality Control: Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:30.43,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I thought friends fought but \Nultimately resolved their differences
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.43,0:23:33.53,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,with their fists and made up, \Nbut I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.53,0:23:36.69,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I'm shocked to learn some \Nfriends don't fight at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.69,0:23:39.15,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Oops, I spoke my mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs19\3c&HF4F3FC&}Next Time
